# AADS Validation

**Status:** ACTIVE FOR VALIDATION (not stable)

## Purpose

Post-change validation and honest Completion Model reporting.

## When to apply

- Code under `src/` is being changed.
- Technical docs under `docs/` or SQL under `supabase/` are being changed.
- Tests are being run or edited.
- Work reaches Operating Model **STATE 06 — VALIDATION**.

Do **not** rely on this rule for purely exploratory Q&A with no implementation.

## Agent behavior

1. Validate correctness, consistency, architecture fit, and documentation impact.
2. Run **existing project** quality commands when applicable (never hardcode stack commands here).
3. Report failures clearly; do not claim success with known task-related errors.
4. Consult checklists by reference only:
   - `docs/historico/aads-framework-v0.4.0.md` (Feature Checklist & DoD sections)
   - `AGENTS.md` (Section 6 — Obrigação de Validação e Completion Model)

## Completion Model

Never reply with only `Concluído.` / `Done.`

| State | Means |
|---|---|
| Implementation Complete | Change implemented; technical validations done for the scope |
| Delivery Complete | Applicable Git delivery finished |
| Release Complete | Available to end users via project release |

Implementation ≠ Delivery ≠ Release.  
List Delivery pending when Implementation Complete is earned but Git delivery is not.

